Instead of one strategy, create a strategy registry.

strategies/
│
├── trend/
├── mean_reversion/
├── breakout/
├── price_action/
├── smc/
├── ict/
├── options/
├── volatility/
└── machine_learning/

Each strategy exposes the same interface:

INPUT
 ↓
FEATURES
 ↓
SIGNAL
 ↓
ENTRY
 ↓
STOP
 ↓
TARGET
 ↓
CONFIDENCE
 ↓
EXPECTED VALUE

Then the system can compare strategies objectively.
